	<Item Name="title" Type="String">Regulation of chemosensitivity in pancreatic cancer cells</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">We performed RNA-seq to investigate gene expression changes in pancreatic cancer cells following chemotherapeutic drug treatment. We identify a reversible senescence state among the drug-tolerant persister cells.</Item>
